       .. rst-class:: rst-columns

       - On-shield :bbl:`20×10 RGB LED matrix`
       - :bbl:`4 GPIO` pin via :bbk:`edge pinout`
       - :bbl:`2 AIN` pin via :bbk:`edge pinout`

       - :bbl:`RGB888`, 24-bit color depth
       - :bbl:`800㎅/ₛ` data rate
       - Adjustable brightness with 256 level
       - 20 × 10 pixels
       - :bbk:`1 RTC with additional SRAM`
       - :bbk:`1 LDR light sensor`
       - :bbk:`1 MIC analog audio sampling`
       - :bbk:`1 RESET key`

       - :bbk:`1 RST signal for RTC`
       - :bbl:`1 I2C` controller for RTC
       - :bbl:`1 ADC` analog input for LDR light sensor
       - :bbl:`1 ADC` analog input for microphone audio sampling

